INSERT INTO `af_remedies` VALUES (1,'Pisces','Boy','Love','English','Pisces boys may face challenges in love due to Jupiter’s wisdom and Neptune/Moon’s dreamy sensitivity. Remedies focus on grounding, stability, and emotional balance.','Yellow Sapphire (Pukhraj)','Brihaspati Puja on Thursdays','Astrologically, Pisces boys in love should strengthen Jupiter with Yellow Sapphire (Pukhraj). Performing Brihaspati Puja on Thursdays balances spiritual and emotional energy. Chanting \'Om Brim Brihaspataye Namah\' on Thursdays and \'Om Chandraya Namah\' on Mondays, fasting, and donating yellow sweets, milk, or rice improve luck. These steps align Jupiter and Moon positively, ensuring success and peace in love.','Socially, Pisces boys should manage over-trusting nature in love by seeking advice from elders. Joining social or cultural groups builds support. Practicing responsibility, discipline, and transparency strengthens trust socially and improves handling of love.','Emotionally, Pisces boys may struggle with over-sensitivity in love. Mindfulness, meditation, and yoga improve stability. Journaling and gratitude exercises help release fear. Creative hobbies like art, poetry, or music channel Neptune’s dreamy energy positively. Grounding practices like spending time in nature or water meditation bring calmness to face love with resilience.','2025-09-05 11:02:48','2025-09-05 11:02:48'),(2,'Pisces','Boy','Health','English','Pisces boys may face challenges in health due to Jupiter’s wisdom and Neptune/Moon’s dreamy sensitivity. Remedies focus on grounding, stability, and emotional balance.','Amethyst','Dhanvantari Puja for health','Astrologically, Pisces boys in health should strengthen Jupiter with Amethyst. Performing Dhanvantari Puja for health balances spiritual and emotional energy. Chanting \'Om Brim Brihaspataye Namah\' on Thursdays and \'Om Chandraya Namah\' on Mondays, fasting, and donating yellow sweets, milk, or rice improve luck. These steps align Jupiter and Moon positively, ensuring success and peace in health.','Socially, Pisces boys should manage over-trusting nature in health by seeking advice from elders. Joining social or cultural groups builds support. Practicing responsibility, discipline, and transparency strengthens trust socially and improves handling of health.','Emotionally, Pisces boys may struggle with over-sensitivity in health. Mindfulness, meditation, and yoga improve stability. Journaling and gratitude exercises help release fear. Creative hobbies like art, poetry, or music channel Neptune’s dreamy energy positively. Grounding practices like spending time in nature or water meditation bring calmness to face health with resilience.','2025-09-05 11:02:48','2025-09-05 11:02:48'),(3,'Pisces','Boy','Job Search','English','Pisces boys may face challenges in job search due to Jupiter’s wisdom and Neptune/Moon’s dreamy sensitivity. Remedies focus on grounding, stability, and emotional balance.','Emerald (Panna)','Vishnu Sahasranama chanting','Astrologically, Pisces boys in job search should strengthen Jupiter with Emerald (Panna). Performing Vishnu Sahasranama chanting balances spiritual and emotional energy. Chanting \'Om Brim Brihaspataye Namah\' on Thursdays and \'Om Chandraya Namah\' on Mondays, fasting, and donating yellow sweets, milk, or rice improve luck. These steps align Jupiter and Moon positively, ensuring success and peace in job search.','Socially, Pisces boys should manage over-trusting nature in job search by seeking advice from elders. Joining social or cultural groups builds support. Practicing responsibility, discipline, and transparency strengthens trust socially and improves handling of job search.','Emotionally, Pisces boys may struggle with over-sensitivity in job search. Mindfulness, meditation, and yoga improve stability. Journaling and gratitude exercises help release fear. Creative hobbies like art, poetry, or music channel Neptune’s dreamy energy positively. Grounding practices like spen