'English','Taurus boys may experience unique struggles in love due to their stubborn yet loyal Venus-driven nature. Remedies bring balance, enhance patience, and align spiritual, social, and emotional energies.','Diamond','Shukra Shanti Puja on Fridays','Astrologically, Taurus boys in love should strengthen Venus energy with Diamond. Performing Shukra Shanti Puja on Fridays ensures blessings from Shukra and stability in life. Regular chanting of Shukra mantras such as \'Om Shum Shukraya Namah\' 108 times daily, fasting on Fridays, and donating white clothes, rice, or milk helps. These astrological steps align Venus positively, attracting harmony and prosperity in love.','Socially, Taurus boys should manage their fixed approach in love through open discussions with family and community. Including elders and mentors ensures trust and approval. Attending cultural gatherings or spiritual sessions with partners, friends, or colleagues strengthens bonds. Practicing transparency and respecting traditions reduces conflicts. Such steps ensure smoother handling of love socially.','Emotionally, Taurus boys may struggle with rigidity during love. Practices like mindfulness, journaling, and yoga help release tension. Developing empathy by active listening and gratitude journaling strengthens emotional resilience. Engaging in creative outlets like music, dance, or art allows Venusian energy to flow positively. Breathing exercises and self-love rituals reduce stress, helping them approach love with calmness and balance.','2025-09-05 11:07:56','2025-09-05 11:07:56'),(82,'Taurus','Boy','Health','English','Taurus boys may experience unique struggles in health due to their stubborn yet loyal Venus-driven nature. Remedies bring balance, enhance patience, and align spiritual, social, and emotional energies.','Emerald (Panna)','Dhanvantari Puja for health','Astrologically, Taurus boys in health should strengthen Venus energy with Emerald (Panna). Performing Dhanvantari Puja for health en