19:03:34'),(281,'Cancer','Girl','Love','English','Cancer girls may face sensitivity in love due to Moon’s emotional influence. Remedies focus on stability, intuition, and building stronger social and emotional balance.','Pearl (Moti)','Chandra Shanti Puja on Mondays','Astrologically, Cancer girls should strengthen Moon for love. Wearing Pearl (Moti) helps calm emotions. Performing Chandra Shanti Puja on Mondays provides peace of mind. Chanting \'Om Chandraya Namah\' 108 times on Mondays, fasting on Purnima, and donating milk, rice, or white clothes balance Moon energy. These steps reduce anxiety, increase clarity, and ensure harmony in love.','Socially, Cancer girls should involve family and mentors when handling love. Participating in cultural or spiritual gatherings enhances acceptance. Respecting elders and openly sharing emotions strengthens trust. They should avoid over-dependence and instead balance relationships with independence. This approach ensures better outcomes in love socially.','Emotionally, Cancer girls may struggle with mood swings in love. Practices like meditation, journaling, and moonlight walks bring calmness. Creative outlets like painting, music, or writing channel emotions positively. Gratitude exercises and active listening deepen bonds. Developing confidence and practicing self-love reduce insecurity, helping them navigate love with emotional resilience.','2025-09-05 11:07:58','2025-09-05 11:07:58'),(282,'Cancer','Girl','Health','English','Cancer girls may face sensitivity in health due to Moon’s emotional influence. Remedies focus on stability, intuition, and building stronger social and emotional balance.','Moonstone','Dhanvantari Puja for health','Astrologically, Cancer girls should strengthen Moon for health. Wearing Moonstone helps calm emotions. Performing Dhanvantari Puja for health provides peace of mind. Chanting \'Om Chandraya Namah\' 108 times on Mondays, fasting on Purnima, and donating milk, rice, or white clothes balance Moon