ucing conflicts related to love.','Emotionally, Scorpio girls may struggle with jealousy and intensity in love. Mindfulness, journaling, and yoga help balance inner energy. Creative hobbies like martial arts, painting, or dance channel passion positively. Gratitude practices and empathy deepen bonds. Breathing exercises and counseling when needed help them handle love with resilience and calm.','2025-09-05 11:07:59','2025-09-05 11:07:59'),(602,'Scorpio','Girl','Health','English','Scorpio girls may face intensity in health due to Mars and Ketu’s transformative influence. Remedies focus on balance, trust, and channeling passion positively.','Yellow Sapphire (Pukhraj)','Dhanvantari Puja for health','Astrologically, Scorpio girls in health benefit from Mars remedies with Yellow Sapphire (Pukhraj). Performing Dhanvantari Puja for health balances Mars and Ketu energy. Chanting \'Om Angarakaya Namah\' 108 times, fasting on Tuesdays, and donating red lentils, jaggery, or copper enhance Mars. Navagraha visits, Rudrabhishek, and Ketu Shanti rituals reduce confusion and ensure success in health.','Socially, Scorpio girls should reduce secrecy in health and practice openness. Involving family and mentors increases trust. Building transparency in communication and sharing goals ensures better social acceptance. Participation in group rituals and cultural gatherings strengthens bonds, reducing conflicts related to health.','Emotionally, Scorpio girls may struggle with jealousy and intensity in health. Mindfulness, journaling, and yoga help balance inner energy. Creative hobbies like martial arts, painting, or dance channel passion positively. Gratitude practices and empathy deepen bonds. Breathing exercises and counseling when needed help them handle health with resilience and calm.','2025-09-05 11:07:59','2025-09-05 11:07:59'),(603,'Scorpio','Girl','Job Search','English','Scorpio girls may face intensity in job search due to Mars and Ketu’s transformative influence. Remedies foc