g in group tasks improve social trust. Being transparent and patient ensures smoother handling of love socially.','Emotionally, Capricorn boys may struggle with pessimism in love. Practices like mindfulness meditation, journaling, and yoga bring calmness. Gratitude exercises and positive affirmations enhance confidence. Creative hobbies like gardening, music, or painting channel Saturn’s energy productively. Patience, optimism, and balanced communication help manage love with emotional resilience.','2025-09-05 11:08:01','2025-09-05 11:08:01'),(722,'Capricorn','Boy','Health','English','Capricorn boys may face challenges in health due to Saturn’s disciplined and restrictive influence. Remedies focus on patience, stability, and long-term balance socially and emotionally.','Amethyst','Dhanvantari Puja for health','Astrologically, Capricorn boys in health should strengthen Saturn by wearing Amethyst. Performing Dhanvantari Puja for health reduces Saturn’s malefic effects. Chanting \'Om Sham Shanicharaya Namah\' 108 times on Saturdays, fasting, and donating black sesame, mustard oil, or iron items appease Shani. These remedies bring discipline, remove obstacles, and create positive progress in health.','Socially, Capricorn boys should reduce over-seriousness in health and focus on teamwork. Engaging in community service, respecting elders, and cooperating in group tasks improve social trust. Being transparent and patient ensures smoother handling of health socially.','Emotionally, Capricorn boys may struggle with pessimism in health. Practices like mindfulness meditation, journaling, and yoga bring calmness. Gratitude exercises and positive affirmations enhance confidence. Creative hobbies like gardening, music, or painting channel Saturn’s energy productively. Patience, optimism, and balanced communication help manage health with emotional resilience.','2025-09-05 11:08:01','2025-09-05 11:08:01'),(723,'Capricorn','Boy','Job Search','English','Capricorn boys may face chal