ly, Aquarius boys in love should balance Saturn and Rahu by wearing Blue Sapphire (Neelam). Performing Shani Shanti Puja on Saturdays stabilizes energies. Chanting \'Om Sham Shanicharaya Namah\' and \'Om Raahve Namah\' 108 times, fasting on Saturdays, and donating black sesame, mustard oil, or blankets appease malefic Saturn and Rahu. These remedies bring discipline, clarity, and success in love.','Socially, Aquarius boys should reduce aloofness in love by engaging with family, peers, and community. Participating in social welfare, cultural events, and teamwork enhances social acceptance. Being transparent and cooperative ensures smoother handling of love socially.','Emotionally, Aquarius boys may struggle with detachment in love. Practices like mindfulness meditation, yoga, and journaling encourage grounding. Gratitude practices and empathy improve relationships. Creative outlets like innovation projects, writing, or music channel Saturn and Rahu’s energy positively. Developing patience, compassion, and balanced communication builds emotional resilience in love.','2025-09-05 11:08:01','2025-09-05 11:08:01'),(802,'Aquarius','Boy','Health','English','Aquarius boys may face challenges in health due to Saturn’s discipline and Rahu’s unpredictability. Remedies focus on balance, clarity, and building stronger emotional and social ties.','Amethyst','Dhanvantari Puja for health','Astrologically, Aquarius boys in health should balance Saturn and Rahu by wearing Amethyst. Performing Dhanvantari Puja for health stabilizes energies. Chanting \'Om Sham Shanicharaya Namah\' and \'Om Raahve Namah\' 108 times, fasting on Saturdays, and donating black sesame, mustard oil, or blankets appease malefic Saturn and Rahu. These remedies bring discipline, clarity, and success in health.','Socially, Aquarius boys should reduce aloofness in health by engaging with family, peers, and community. Participating in social welfare, cultural events, and teamwork enhances social acceptance. Being t