ve with resilience.','2025-09-05 11:08:01','2025-09-05 11:08:01'),(922,'Pisces','Girl','Health','English','Pisces girls may face challenges in health due to Jupiter’s wisdom and Neptune/Moon’s dreamy sensitivity. Remedies focus on grounding, stability, and emotional balance.','Amethyst','Dhanvantari Puja for health','Astrologically, Pisces girls in health should strengthen Jupiter with Amethyst. Performing Dhanvantari Puja for health balances spiritual and emotional energy. Chanting \'Om Brim Brihaspataye Namah\' on Thursdays and \'Om Chandraya Namah\' on Mondays, fasting, and donating yellow sweets, milk, or rice improve luck. These steps align Jupiter and Moon positively, ensuring success and peace in health.','Socially, Pisces girls should manage over-trusting nature in health by seeking advice from elders. Joining social or cultural groups builds support. Practicing responsibility, discipline, and transparency strengthens trust socially and improves handling of health.','Emotionally, Pisces girls may struggle with over-sensitivity in health. Mindfulness, meditation, and yoga improve stability. Journaling and gratitude exercises help release fear. Creative hobbies like art, poetry, or music channel Neptune’s dreamy energy positively. Grounding practices like spending time in nature or water meditation bring calmness to face health with resilience.','2025-09-05 11:08:01','2025-09-05 11:08:01'),(923,'Pisces','Girl','Job Search','English','Pisces girls may face challenges in job search due to Jupiter’s wisdom and Neptune/Moon’s dreamy sensitivity. Remedies focus on grounding, stability, and emotional balance.','Emerald (Panna)','Vishnu Sahasranama chanting','Astrologically, Pisces girls in job search should strengthen Jupiter with Emerald (Panna). Performing Vishnu Sahasranama chanting balances spiritual and emotional energy. Chanting \'Om Brim Brihaspataye Namah\' on Thursdays and \'Om Chandraya Namah\' on Mondays, fasting, and donating yellow sweets, milk, or rice